"Temperature"
msgstr "Avionics Anonymous 空中数据计算机 — 空速、气压计与空气温度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-adc.rst:7 81b65288b80e403da8f524d45279a9e1
msgid ""
"The `Avionics Anonymous Air Data Computer "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/microadc>`__ is tiny, richly-"
"featured Air Data Computer (ADC) for small unmanned airplanes. It includes "
"an MS5611 barometric pressure sensor for 10cm-resolution altitude, a "
"Honeywell RSC-series differential pressure transducer for extremely accurate"
" airspeed, and a thermistor interface with high-resolution convertor for air"
" temperature measurement with better than 1 degree precision. The device "
"interfaces to your autopilot via a robust `DroneCAN "
"<https://dronecan.org>`__ interface, which provides high reliability "
"connections to peripherals over greater distances than I2C."
msgstr ""
"`Avionics Anonymous 空中数据计算机 "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/microadc>`__ "
"是一款体积微小、功能丰富的小型无人机空中数据计算机（ADC）。它集成了 MS5611 气压传感器（10cm 分辨率高度）、Honeywell RSC "
"系列差压传感器（高精度空速）以及带高分辨率转换器的热敏电阻接口（优于 1 度精度的空气温度测量）。设备通过稳健的 `DroneCAN "
"<https://dronecan.org>`__ 接口与飞控通信，比 I2C 提供更高可靠性和更远连接距离。"

